  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Telekinesis; <strong>CL</strong> 4th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 1,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis short metal rod fits well into the hand and is small enough that it is barely longer than a clenched fist. You may activate it as a move action and cause it to telekinetically hook on to a solid, inanimate surface within 200 feet, allowing it to act as if you had a rope securely linked between the rod and that surface. A second move action causes the hook to retract, drawing the rod and its wielder towards the surface at a rate of 50 feet per round. You may also use a free action to disconnect the hook from any surface it is attached to. The hook can support a load of up to Huge size.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Telekinesis sphere (Tether); <strong>Cost</strong> 500 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
